    "name": "UK Collision Severity Prediction",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Machine learning pipeline for predicting the severity of road traffic collisions in the United Kingdom using the Department for Transport STATS19 open dataset (2019–2023). The experiment trains and evaluates multiple classifiers (LightGBM, HistGradientBoosting, Random Forest) on collision records retrieved from a DBRepo relational database, producing evaluation outputs including confusion matrices, performance comparison charts, and feature importance plots.",
